### Add an item
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/packing
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333331", "category": "CLOTHING", "name": "Kaos", "quantity": 3 }

### List
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/packing
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tick (null fields are left unchanged)
PATCH {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/packing/33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333331
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isPacked": true }

### Uncheck all -> 204
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/packing/uncheck-all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/packing/33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333331
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
